# Blog Layout Website

A simple and professional blog layout website built using **HTML and CSS**. It provides a clean and structured layout for displaying blog posts and content.

## Features

* Clean and modern design
* Navigation bar
* Blog post layout
* Featured content section
* Categories section
* Responsive layout
* Simple and user-friendly interface

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3

## How to Run

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open `index.html` in any web browser.

## Purpose

This project was created to practice front-end web development and build a structured and responsive blog layout using HTML and CSS.

